    "engine_seeds": "oracle: the majority over the 32 oracle seeds above; residual seeds (pools and surrogates only, disjoint from the oracle's): primary seed_for('task', start, task, H), secondary seed_for('task-secondary', start, task, H, k), k=0..7",
    "residual_definition": "truth seeds seed_for('task-truth', start, forced key, H, k), k < 64, shared by the tasks of a start, disjoint from every residual and oracle seed; residual of a pool plan = judge score minus its mean margin over all 64; the surrogate selects on a pool plan's mean over truth seeds 0..31 (a cross-entropy candidate's over 0..15) plus a drawn search residual and accepts on the selected plan's mean over 32..63 plus the paired verdict residual; the floor's selected plan is judged by the majority oracle; the nine old seeds are not used by the floor",
    "residual_pool": "economy",
    "residual_rows": 1000,
    "flip_floor": "flip surrogate and flip_closed_form_family_rates use confusion rates pooled within the task family and the per-instance base rate; the instrument's built-in flip_closed_form pools confusion rates over every behaviour plan",
